{"unit_id":"kiefeng__dsh-lan-memory#card-zh","repo":"kiefeng/dsh-lan-memory","commit":"4edabd09b2f4258a902abb754bfb2d455db3e908","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-memory（DSH 插件，Web 与 Desktop 客户端）：为 DSH 提供本地文件记忆和可编辑的人格层。它在宿主进程注册记忆工具，并把人格规则、常驻记忆和编译画像注入提示上下文；设置页管理记忆、经验、收件箱、人格和维护。主要功能包括记录与分页浏览记忆、按关键词召回手动记忆或自动事实、从会话记录编译摘要与画像，以及在对话尾部显示 mood 状态卡。适合希望跨会话保留偏好并自行管理记忆文件的 DSH 用户。需要 DSH Web GUI 和 webServer 服务；数据默认写入 DSH_HOME/lan-memory，可用 DSH_LAN_DATA_DIR 覆盖。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48","lib/index.js:263","lib/index.js:549","lib/client.js:309","lib/client.js:845","lib/store.js:28"]}
{"unit_id":"kiefeng__dsh-lan-memory#card-en","repo":"kiefeng/dsh-lan-memory","commit":"4edabd09b2f4258a902abb754bfb2d455db3e908","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-lan-memory adds file-based memory and persona support to DSH Web and Desktop. It provides tools to save, browse and search memories, compiles session notes into a profile, and displays mood cards. A settings page manages memory and persona. It requires the DSH Web GUI and stores data locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48","lib/index.js:263","lib/index.js:549","lib/client.js:309","lib/client.js:845","lib/store.js:28"]}
