{"unit_id":"kiefeng__dsh-lan-memory#caveat-1","repo":"kiefeng/dsh-lan-memory","commit":"4edabd09b2f4258a902abb754bfb2d455db3e908","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-memory 使用前须知：自动编译会调用 DSH 当前模型处理会话线索；捕获本身写入本机 journal。可关闭自动编译。见 lib/compile.js:1-8、lib/capture.js:15-17。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/compile.js:1-8","lib/capture.js:15-17"]}
